        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le texte gris qui termine vos mots pendant la saisie."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The lists behind Apple menu > Recent Items and each app’s Open Recent menu. Favorites in the Finder sidebar stay. Open apps may keep their list until you log out.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les listes du menu Pomme > Éléments récents et du menu Ouvrir l’élément récent de chaque app. Les favoris de la barre latérale du Finder restent. Les apps ouvertes peuvent garder leur liste jusqu’à la déconnexion."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The play key opens Music when nothing else is playing.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La touche lecture ouvre Musique quand rien d’autre ne joue."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The service that looks up what is on screen.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le service qui identifie ce qui est à l’écran."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The services that run Apple Intelligence models.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les services qui font tourner les modèles d’Apple Intelligence."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The simplest way to make images from text, with no settings to learn.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La façon la plus simple de créer des images à partir de texte, sans réglages à apprendre."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The window title shows the full folder path.": {
